IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STOCK-REQUESTER.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 ITEM-NAME PIC X(16) VALUE "WIDGET".
01 STOCK-REPLY PIC X(96).
SCREEN SECTION.
01 STOCK-SCREEN SIZE 14, 120.
05 FILLER AT 1, 2 VALUE "Pulse Pathway - MSSQL stock inquiry".
05 FILLER AT 3, 2 VALUE "Item:".
05 ITEM-FIELD AT 3, 12 PIC X(16) USING ITEM-NAME.
05 FILLER AT 5, 2 VALUE "Counts:".
05 COUNTS-FIELD AT 5, 12 PIC X(96) FROM STOCK-REPLY.
05 FILLER AT 8, 2 VALUE "inStock = total physical stock; committed = quantity held by active orders".
05 FILLER AT 10, 2 VALUE "Available to promise = inStock minus committed.".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
DISPLAY BASE STOCK-SCREEN.
ACCEPT STOCK-SCREEN.
SEND ITEM-NAME TO "inventory-stock" REPLY CODE 0 YIELDS STOCK-REPLY.
DISPLAY STOCK-SCREEN.
STOP RUN.
